@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava demo korisnika
# @name demo
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "demo@dermawise.rs", "password": "demo123"}

### Upitnik sa poznatom alergijom na methylisothiazolinone
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/questionnaire
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./data/acne-with-mi-allergy.json

### Dnevnik: pre 4 dana uveden losion za lice sa Kathon CG, nanosi se na obraze i čelo
POST {{host}}/api/diary/products
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -4 d}}",
  "product": {
    "name": "Losion za lice",
    "ingredients": [{"name": "Aqua"}, {"name": "Glycerin"}, {"name": "Kathon CG"}],
    "applicationAreas": ["CHEEKS", "FOREHEAD"]
  }
}

### Dnevnik: juče crvenilo na obrazima, CEP javlja moguću kontaktnu reakciju (operator after[0s, 14d])
POST {{host}}/api/diary/symptoms
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -1 d}}", "type": "ERYTHEMA", "location": "CHEEKS"}

### BC primer 2: uzročnik je kathon cg (sadrži alergen), methylisothiazolinone (alergija) i methylchloroisothiazolinone (unakrsno)
GET {{host}}/api/backward/contact-dermatitis-cause
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}

### Unakrsna reaktivnost: methylchloroisothiazolinone je poznat alergen jer je u istoj grupi kao methylisothiazolinone
GET {{host}}/api/backward/allergen-check?sastojak=methylchloroisothiazolinone
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}

### Analiza: kontaktni dermatitis uz akne, napomene sa uzročnicima, hidrokortizon i emolijens
POST {{host}}/api/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
